From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude Agent <claude-agent@invalid>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 03:52:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tests: Run the display target user override case on its own

/wayland/display-targets/user-override replaces the fixture output's
EDID, connector type, supported HDR EOTFs and color spaces, toggles
forced HDR and the reference luminance factor, and restores only the
color mode. Like its display target neighbours, it must run in its own
invocation, so that later cases of the main invocation do not depend on
registration order, and so that it has its own retryable result.
---
 src/tests/meson.build | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/tests/meson.build b/src/tests/meson.build
index bf0c3ff..5e57e11 100644
--- a/src/tests/meson.build
+++ b/src/tests/meson.build
@@ -968,6 +968,7 @@ wayland_test_cases = [
       '/wayland/published/reference-factor',
       '/wayland/display-targets/cta',
       '/wayland/display-targets/sdr-native',
+      '/wayland/display-targets/user-override',
       '/wayland/night-light/bt2100-scanout',
     ],
     'depends': [
